OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the guardians who look after
OL,4,Athe island defibs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are more than 13,800
OL,7,Fdefibrillators registered with a
OL,8,Fguardian in the South West, and two of
OL,9,Fthem have been named as the UKs "most
OL,10,Fextraordinary".
OL,12,FThe British Heart Foundation (BHF) said
OL,13,Fthe defibrillator on Lundy Island,
OL,14,FDevon was the country's most remote,
OL,15,Fand St Agnes, Isles of Scilly was most
OL,16,Fsouthern.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
